{"2908820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Virus Hunter", "steam_appid": 2908820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual roguelike game where you become nanomachines to protect the human body from viruses and bacteria.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time progresses, the human body ages and becomes increasingly vulnerable to viruses, bacteria, cancer cells, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/606c35692ef16bd3e9a5ecec199fb4df.poster.avif?t=1775811262\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/606c35692ef16bd3e9a5ecec199fb4df.webm?t=1775811262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nanomachines come with a power-up feature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire various weapons and eliminate external threats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viruses and bacteria become stronger over time, so strategically upgrade your weapons to stay ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/2e9710a9fca29fe5a3cf52a2474b34eb.poster.avif?t=1775811262\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/2e9710a9fca29fe5a3cf52a2474b34eb.webm?t=1775811262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nanomachine weapons can evolve into extremely powerful “Synthesis Weapons” when specific conditions are met.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different combinations and discover them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/f05fce3ede510e91599294a056461cdd.poster.avif?t=1775811262\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/f05fce3ede510e91599294a056461cdd.webm?t=1775811262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Tips:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Focus on collecting experience points first. Start by defeating enemies you can handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Survival is key in the early game. Master the art of dodging and running away effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Look for items on the map. Don’t miss chances to heal or power up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Find weapons that suit your playstyle. Your strategy will change depending on the combinations you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Actively obtain Synthesis Weapons to gain the advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synthesis Weapon Recipes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/17ac571884c7b449ee30180ba9937e84.avif?t=1775811262\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone is free to stream this game, and no prior permission is required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you stream the game, we’ll do our best to share it as much as possible. To make it easier for us to find, please use the hashtag <strong>#VirusHunter</strong> when posting about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, you can notify us directly on X (Twitter) at <strong>@kenjikatou</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> The use of this game for illegal activities, unethical purposes, or anything that violates public order and morals is strictly prohibited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bug Reports</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find any bugs in the game, please report them via the Community Hub discussion board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual roguelike game where you become nanomachines to protect the human body from viruses and bacteria.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time progresses, the human body ages and becomes increasingly vulnerable to viruses, bacteria, cancer cells, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/606c35692ef16bd3e9a5ecec199fb4df.poster.avif?t=1775811262\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/606c35692ef16bd3e9a5ecec199fb4df.webm?t=1775811262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nanomachines come with a power-up feature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire various weapons and eliminate external threats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viruses and bacteria become stronger over time, so strategically upgrade your weapons to stay ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/2e9710a9fca29fe5a3cf52a2474b34eb.poster.avif?t=1775811262\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/2e9710a9fca29fe5a3cf52a2474b34eb.webm?t=1775811262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nanomachine weapons can evolve into extremely powerful “Synthesis Weapons” when specific conditions are met.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different combinations and discover them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/f05fce3ede510e91599294a056461cdd.poster.avif?t=1775811262\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/f05fce3ede510e91599294a056461cdd.webm?t=1775811262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Tips:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Focus on collecting experience points first. Start by defeating enemies you can handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Survival is key in the early game. Master the art of dodging and running away effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Look for items on the map. Don’t miss chances to heal or power up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Find weapons that suit your playstyle. Your strategy will change depending on the combinations you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Actively obtain Synthesis Weapons to gain the advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synthesis Weapon Recipes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/17ac571884c7b449ee30180ba9937e84.avif?t=1775811262\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone is free to stream this game, and no prior permission is required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you stream the game, we’ll do our best to share it as much as possible. To make it easier for us to find, please use the hashtag <strong>#VirusHunter</strong> when posting about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, you can notify us directly on X (Twitter) at <strong>@kenjikatou</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> The use of this game for illegal activities, unethical purposes, or anything that violates public order and morals is strictly prohibited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bug Reports</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find any bugs in the game, please report them via the Community Hub discussion board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Become a nanomachine and defend the human body from viruses and bacteria! How long you can live depends on your efforts.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/header.jpg?t=1775811262", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/39bba99c194bdb6dbf95b0eed2e88c6b4b7a6dc7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775811262", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/39bba99c194bdb6dbf95b0eed2e88c6b4b7a6dc7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775811262", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> corei5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum: